  "voiceover_upload_id": null,
  "voiceoverUpload": null,
  "has_voiceover": false,
  "description": "It Is Ok To Capture Small Profits",
  "body_html": "<p>When the best set ups are failing, we shift to cash. </p><p>The last 2 days of this week, we have been fighting the VIX. Maybe you want to take some modest profits off the table. Maybe push your stop up. Regardless what you do, make sure you do not blindly take on a bunch of risk. The last few weeks we had some explosive wins. Lets not have those erased by hoping the VIX goes down or that are chart set up works. Nothing works 100% of the time, and I have been noticing this losing momentum. Questions are always welcome in the chat, and I will let you know which positions I cut the moment I do in the chat. Thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa4c61c40-9364-4166-877a-b0163fb9610d_854x854.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p>",
